# Whitelist approach: ignore everything, then allow only the files that are
# safe to publish. Personal health data must never reach this public repo.
#
# NEVER committed (stay ignored): daily_health_checkin.html (plaintext source),
# health_data.json, Daily_Health_Tracking.xlsx, training plans, *.bak backups,
# and .deploy-passphrase (the decryption key).
#
# index.html is SAFE to publish: its health entries are encrypted with
# AES-256-GCM and cannot be read without the passphrase.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!manifest.json
!service-worker.js
!encrypt_deploy.py
!PWA-SETUP.md
!GITHUB-PAGES-SETUP.md
!GIT-WORKFLOW.md
